#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hello World: Your First Quantum Circuit"
msgstr "Hello World: Circuit Quantum Pertama Anda"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"hello-world.ipynb\" description=\"This tutorial was created for doQumentation.\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"hello-world.ipynb\" description=\"Tutorial ini dibuat untuk doQumentation.\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a [Bell state](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_state) (two entangled qubits) and run it three ways:\n"
msgstr "Bina sebuah [Bell state](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_state) (dua qubit yang terjerat) dan jalankan dengan tiga cara:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Ideal simulation** — perfect results, no account needed\n"
msgstr "**Simulasi ideal** — hasil sempurna, tiada akaun diperlukan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Noisy simulation** — simulates a real device, no account needed\n"
msgstr "**Simulasi berbising** — mensimulasikan peranti sebenar, tiada akaun diperlukan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Real quantum hardware** — requires a free IBM Quantum account (setup steps below)\n"
msgstr "**Perkakasan quantum sebenar** — memerlukan akaun IBM Quantum percuma (langkah persediaan di bawah)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the circuit {#build-the-circuit}"
msgstr "Bina Circuit {#build-the-circuit}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Ideal simulation (no account needed) {#option-1-ideal-simulation-no-account-needed}"
msgstr "Pilihan 1: Simulasi ideal (tiada akaun diperlukan) {#option-1-ideal-simulation-no-account-needed}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Uses `StatevectorSampler` — a local simulator with perfect, noise-free results.\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan `StatevectorSampler` — simulator tempatan dengan hasil yang sempurna dan bebas bunyi.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Noisy simulation (no account needed) {#option-2-noisy-simulation-no-account-needed}"
msgstr "Pilihan 2: Simulasi berbising (tiada akaun diperlukan) {#option-2-noisy-simulation-no-account-needed}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Uses `FakeManilaV2` — a local simulator that mimics a real IBM quantum device, including its noise characteristics. The circuit must first be transpiled (adapted) to the device's gate set and qubit connectivity.\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan `FakeManilaV2` — simulator tempatan yang meniru peranti quantum IBM sebenar, termasuk ciri-ciri bunyinya. Circuit perlu di-transpile (disesuaikan) terlebih dahulu kepada set gate dan sambungan qubit peranti tersebut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 3: Real quantum hardware {#option-3-real-quantum-hardware}"
msgstr "Pilihan 3: Perkakasan quantum sebenar {#option-3-real-quantum-hardware}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requires a free IBM Quantum account. To set one up:\n"
msgstr "Memerlukan akaun IBM Quantum percuma. Untuk mendaftarkan satu:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) — no credit card required for the first 30 days\n"
msgstr "Daftar di [quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) — tiada kad kredit diperlukan untuk 30 hari pertama\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sign in at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) and select region **us-east** (required for the free Open Plan)\n"
msgstr "Log masuk di [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) dan pilih rantau **us-east** (diperlukan untuk Open Plan percuma)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an instance (free Open Plan) at [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) if you don't have one yet\n"
msgstr "Cipta sebuah instance (Open Plan percuma) di [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) jika anda belum memilikinya\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an API key at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) (or at [cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys))\n"
msgstr "Cipta API key di [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) (atau di [cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys))\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Copy your **CRN** (Cloud Resource Name) from your [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page\n"
msgstr "Salin **CRN** (Cloud Resource Name) anda dari halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) anda\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then, if you haven't saved your credentials yet in this Binder session, run the cell below. Replace `<your-api-key>` with the API key from step 4, and `<your-crn>` with the CRN from step 5.\n"
msgstr "Kemudian, jika anda belum menyimpan kelayakan anda dalam sesi Binder ini, jalankan sel di bawah. Gantikan `<your-api-key>` dengan API key dari langkah 4, dan `<your-crn>` dengan CRN dari langkah 5.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Jobs on real hardware may take some time depending on queue times. If the cell is still running, you can check your job status and see the results at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads?user=me).\n"
msgstr "**Nota:** Kerja pada perkakasan sebenar mungkin mengambil masa bergantung pada masa dalam giliran. Jika sel masih berjalan, anda boleh menyemak status kerja dan melihat keputusan di [quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads?user=me).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What next? {#what-next}"
msgstr "Apa seterusnya? {#what-next}"

